### api-financas — exemplos de requisição
### Variável de ambiente do VS Code REST Client / JetBrains HTTP Client.
@base = http://localhost:3000
@email = demo@financas.dev
@senha = demo12345

### Health check (público)
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Registrar usuário
POST {{base}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Leonardo Carrilho",
  "email": "leonardo@example.com",
  "password": "senha-segura-123"
}

### Login (copie o token da resposta)
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{senha}}"
}

@token = COLE_O_TOKEN_AQUI

### Usuário autenticado
GET {{base}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Contas
GET {{base}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Nova conta
POST {{base}}/api/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Conta corrente",
  "type": "checking",
  "initialBalanceCents": 250000
}

### Categorias de despesa
GET {{base}}/api/categories?type=expense
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Nova categoria
POST {{base}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mercado",
  "type": "expense",
  "color": "#f59e0b"
}

### Nova transação (valores em centavos)
POST {{base}}/api/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": 1,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "type": "expense",
  "amountCents": 62400,
  "description": "Compras do mês",
  "occurredOn": "2026-10-09"
}

### Listagem com filtros e paginação
GET {{base}}/api/transactions?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31&type=expense&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Resumo do mês atual
GET {{base}}/api/reports/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Resumo de setembro
GET {{base}}/api/reports/summary?from=2026-09-01&to=2026-09-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Exportar CSV do período
GET {{base}}/api/reports/transactions.csv?from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
